            <div xml:id="m-cb76a5e4-09b8-4617-b6fc-8a6730177dd1">
              <lg xml:id="m-9a1f7888-64ce-4044-8096-6ffcd3173ca4">
                <l xml:id="m-bdf29536-70fd-418b-b862-c4d5e21c7927" facs="#m-76bf4d82-c6ba-48f5-9585-06b26e13f9c8" label="ambiguous">whit Tuesday.</l><l xml:id="m-f1501a8d-cec8-4f75-a692-c8bf3b158be1" facs="#m-f552c3c0-c74f-4042-9070-6df3c39fa266" label="ambiguous">so1</l><l xml:id="m-b907eb2f-e19b-41fb-ab36-e78cedb905c7" facs="#m-bf2cda5c-ac66-4051-a989-ed74fb649e1a" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-e4a9d420-11a0-48ef-86a2-d26679158ed0" facs="#m-8e13e9dd-4893-4d1f-a012-5023b320f090" label="lyrics-like">II Dsit nobis, quaésumus Dómine, l get, * et ab ómnibus tueátur advér¬</l><l xml:id="m-7f050d40-e21b-44b6-9090-c17e95793372" facs="#m-30367715-2a64-45f7-aac5-31463b87b0d1" label="lyrics-like">A virtus Spiritus Sancti:t quael sis. Per Dóminum... in unitáte eiús¬</l><l xml:id="m-ceb5ac3c-3b81-4978-8e99-2c18229134ee" facs="#m-1efbaee8-a120-465c-a517-ab3d8b88bb94" label="lyrics-like">et corda nostra cleménter expúr- dem Spiritus Sancti Deus.</l><l xml:id="m-695e969f-b564-4193-815e-f46c6d37cc8e" facs="#m-4dcb0e65-913e-470d-abd2-11169d1f17d4" label="ambiguous">Lectio Actuum Apostolorum. Act. S. c.</l><l xml:id="m-61a84ac8-ca94-4ae3-bc53-61d854decfd5" facs="#m-267f619e-2d5f-4c7c-9850-ce30779d1f62" label="lyrics-like">N diébus illis: Cum audíssent (ritum Sanctum: nondum enim in</l><l xml:id="m-7ed1a27d-29a8-43da-b58d-fb920b9a816c" facs="#m-a576a913-5b16-443d-9de6-f815851559ee" label="lyrics-like">L Apóstoli, qui erant Jerosólymis,</l><l xml:id="m-4048f05c-c930-4a4b-be73-d13a34a3b329" facs="#m-535e2fd9-7c43-455c-aeeb-a252f3f396d4" label="lyrics-like">quemquam illórum vénerat, sed</l><l xml:id="m-4dc4c224-fd11-43b0-a43b-2bce65d48781" facs="#m-b4798be8-f2f2-4e82-b914-d878759d1d94" label="lyrics-like">quod recepisset Samaría verbum</l><l xml:id="m-b9ae31a6-7f81-47c4-bd75-5d1668e582be" facs="#m-da0d8074-ff65-483a-892f-79d305af30b9" label="lyrics-like">baptizáti tantum erant in nómine</l><l xml:id="m-9dc45d85-f258-4db2-9086-3477eabb5c9d" facs="#m-494ed4fb-11ad-44b3-acbf-505a2e1c0afd" label="lyrics-like">Dómini Jesu. Tunc imponébant</l><l xml:id="m-05680d1e-0295-489d-9209-f41be0b5a1d6" facs="#m-305951dd-d10d-479c-8cc2-fc15c6191833" label="lyrics-like">Dei, misérunt ad eos Petrum et</l><l xml:id="m-57aad530-1869-4846-8996-6e000da0ab37" facs="#m-c8cdfaf4-fc56-44d0-8aff-97046ae183a8" label="lyrics-like">Joánnem. Qui cum veníssent, ora¬ manus super illos, et accipiébant</l><l xml:id="m-28fda0af-9771-4caa-89e4-1ef629e795c3" facs="#m-a7c2e51c-1263-4c43-81ce-ae169d8f5edb" label="lyrics-like">vérunt pro ipsis, ut accíperent Spi¬itum Sanctum.</l><l xml:id="m-467f52d6-59ab-4a1b-a7fb-514cb992e96f" facs="#m-9d1756c3-f202-419c-847f-9b748b3b3eed" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-0331fba4-1606-4b9e-bfed-6141cd7a4f8a" facs="#m-c4c00f5b-62fb-471e-b96e-238edc593c91" label="lyrics-like">ALle¬ lú¬ iaij.</l><l xml:id="m-d0a802fa-4a40-4d02-8297-95732222d952" facs="#m-2cf92323-cf07-4c51-969c-af0ff612401b" label="lyrics-like">V. Spíri-tus</l><l xml:id="m-e6b93821-8a57-4703-a994-77288d02d39e" facs="#m-ca56b123-a2aa-428b-be02-2a32f53ff91f" label="lyrics-like">* vó¬</l><l xml:id="m-ce8d1cc6-dab2-47b6-8e01-6183e95023e3" facs="#m-1d32be13-9f53-4bfa-921e-dce6b218c540" label="lyrics-like">Sánctus</l><l xml:id="m-be0853de-01ce-4ea4-b801-623109c54c69" facs="#m-c5f659fa-22e5-482b-be3d-fd6f28e96a68" label="lyrics-like">do-cébit vos quaecúmque dí-xe-ro</l><l xml:id="m-f773b1bd-baae-45df-99ac-d165867936e1" facs="#m-f22e6fcf-7221-4124-98c7-67f56f7cf6c6" label="ambiguous">bis.</l><l xml:id="m-7a43ec5f-39a4-43d3-8735-fbb1ced8dbec" facs="#m-af4e79ee-4a41-45e3-8387-0f7b78c329c3" label="lyrics-like">Allelúia. V. Véni Sáncte Spiritus. D. 880.</l><l xml:id="m-0e48b0a5-8416-44d1-a52d-75b7a9c33a06" facs="#m-f5fd8a00-43c7-41c0-8633-36b675de17ea" label="lyrics-like">Sequence. Véni Sáncte Spiritus. Allelúia. D. 880.</l><l xml:id="m-66192e4a-dfcc-4a96-829f-071a4d81c658" facs="#m-82db16b9-e329-4576-99a4-15b011fb48ce" label="ambiguous">* Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Joannem. Joann. 10.</l><l xml:id="m-aba110a7-1bb0-4847-96e5-4b8acc3bbf9c" facs="#m-309e0195-87ac-4013-aa55-bf6af5d27c57" label="lyrics-like">TN illo témpore: Dixit Jesus Pha-l Hoc provérbium dixit eis Jesus. Illi</l><l xml:id="m-d9ecb134-02ba-4098-a5f6-b4f18ce4774a" facs="#m-12a86a70-5f89-4a69-bf53-09c5b73b3267" label="lyrics-like">L risaéis: Amen, amen dico vobis:</l><l xml:id="m-b48d1c3f-ca85-497e-ab5e-48577105e7f8" facs="#m-e78f29a9-6510-4d2e-b613-38687705a6f3" label="lyrics-like">autem non cognovérunt quid loque¬</l><l xml:id="m-403a8ade-6030-4a86-9b3b-30a54f5fb390" facs="#m-87555094-0546-4c6e-9e80-528ddc8525d3" label="lyrics-like">rétur eis. Dixit ergo eis iterum Je¬</l><l xml:id="m-30890429-c497-4754-9142-08e5c7291b5b" facs="#m-5a37903a-8cfe-4fa3-9d48-3fda230b6007" label="lyrics-like">qui non intrat per óstium in ovile</l><l xml:id="m-ef8e8765-5921-48d6-9ed5-1c9674be2276" facs="#m-e7c89c8e-7ad8-4832-9eac-e1031b15f118" label="ambiguous">sus: Amen, amen dico vobis, quia</l><l xml:id="m-fcb757a0-083e-4883-aeac-434a4ed0e0e8" facs="#m-0539a079-21d5-4c4e-90cf-9a988b318c5c" label="lyrics-like">óvium, sed ascéndit aliúnde, ille</l><l xml:id="m-a9ce581a-1750-4647-a5a5-26c9ea284fa1" facs="#m-a53239fd-2a6a-4ba5-938b-0a82a0fc0d2b" label="ambiguous">fur est, et latro. Qui autem intrat</l><l xml:id="m-371643e4-5fc2-4acf-896f-debcaaf8b506" facs="#m-4dcb15c6-19ac-466c-8d33-36e23e87e534" label="lyrics-like">ego sum óstium óvium. Omnes</l><l xml:id="m-7ea324da-370c-4801-bb2c-9ebc52ea5af1" facs="#m-03d75453-7037-448e-ac63-ab30a516c289" label="lyrics-like">per óstium, pastor est óvium. Huic</l><l xml:id="m-1944ed97-7e79-4100-9c8a-423d3781ee76" facs="#m-33b4116c-2062-477d-942b-6fab3cb4afc2" label="lyrics-like">quotquot venérunt, fures sunt, et</l><l xml:id="m-8c0c024b-85e1-47a4-85bd-01ebdecfb8f4" facs="#m-ff192c70-d1ba-4aa3-9a10-161141c83096" label="lyrics-like">latrónes, et non audiérunt eos oves.</l><l xml:id="m-0dc321a6-55b1-48d9-9fa6-98d21c9ecb23" facs="#m-f3cd1776-93bb-42b2-9889-33d09422b03c" label="lyrics-like">ostiárius áperit, et oves vocem ejus</l><l xml:id="m-c4d5bb03-04dc-4f14-96ab-c8873833f482" facs="#m-32252b45-caa6-4117-a73f-3cb6a4702f9c" label="lyrics-like">Ego sum óstium. Per me si quis</l><l xml:id="m-48b188a6-e8e3-418d-bc69-72dad25aafc2" facs="#m-356a261a-5a19-415e-af8f-7c5fd921082c" label="lyrics-like">áudiunt, et próprias oves vocat no¬</l><l xml:id="m-82314a21-77d4-4c2c-b209-55d4b0846d08" facs="#m-1a33ecdc-8233-4718-8669-fad30f244eb9" label="lyrics-like">introierit, salvábitur: et ingredié¬</l><l xml:id="m-bf2d8f79-0039-44aa-a664-565a2808c4bd" facs="#m-be52c35f-677f-4b88-b99d-b2a1219831ca" label="lyrics-like">minátim, et edúcit eas. Et cum pró¬</l><l xml:id="m-6fa1e77a-7670-4e1c-adcd-1a39acf844c2" facs="#m-8711c76a-75e1-43fe-aa17-279fa59935aa" label="lyrics-like">prias oves emíserit, ante eas vadit:</l><l xml:id="m-930d2dff-6df9-4d39-8466-47daca7ae05c" facs="#m-e8a04ac9-14ae-4bd9-86fa-2d6b25656dc3" label="lyrics-like">tur, et egrediétur, et páscua invé¬</l><l xml:id="m-53f752d1-62dc-4fbb-8a21-cad5c1fc474f" facs="#m-06d1eef8-5e31-4523-a5d2-4083cf937359" label="lyrics-like">et oves illum sequúntur, quia sciunt niet. Fur non venit nisi ut furétur,</l><l xml:id="m-f14e5485-6dac-4e63-9263-09e62bf4e587" facs="#m-e41176f3-8fd5-4349-ad98-27473a65bdd7" label="lyrics-like">vocem ejus. Aliénum autem non l et mactet, et perdat. Ego veni ut</l><l xml:id="m-dd19b783-e1e5-4687-98ec-0d1ad3d2e4ec" facs="#m-3a8dd494-99a5-415c-94d2-e0edd6f23f5d" label="lyrics-like">vitam hábeant, et abundántius há¬</l><l xml:id="m-4e3c1bec-8d2c-4f62-bc92-3b450344ac50" facs="#m-93af3ac1-f528-4748-895e-590a0750097f" label="lyrics-like">sequúntur, sed fúgiunt ab eo: quia</l><l xml:id="m-12628d15-51e0-4633-bbcd-e132f3f63d2e" facs="#m-a414d1d9-9025-45ea-be00-8935b6f40728" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-54cf9bde-c26a-4f89-9654-8f92ff2f828a" facs="#m-ed26af82-240c-42d5-9a54-47d9c4d91a06" label="lyrics-like">non novérunt vocem alienórum.  beant.</l><l xml:id="m-faa59645-26ab-4f1a-acc2-4a59b33e9b8d" facs="#m-ce2144cc-65c4-428c-ba99-77356ff0bf78" label="ambiguous">Offertory. Portas caeli. p. 795.</l><l xml:id="m-b97b5aec-a9cd-4a9d-9f25-63f679782c60" facs="#m-dfcbbe7f-a703-4c23-b0ba-7bbdbf2bd2eb" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-589ccfac-03f0-4a0e-9084-eeb4b6d2b336" facs="#m-ac2438c7-5a39-4852-bd0c-76431d837fe9" label="lyrics-like">DUríficet nos, quaésumus, Dómi-et dignos sacra participatióne effi¬</l><l xml:id="m-b85fbb31-0922-4c3f-9170-321d776a0747" facs="#m-809e329f-74ba-4542-b096-a1fe2a819a29" label="lyrics-like">Ene, múneris praeséntis oblátio: ciat. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-44a022aa-4511-4fc3-8ff1-3f6ae4863be3" facs="#m-37c02449-4908-46fe-be67-256540493e8d" label="text-like">Preface of Pentecost, p. 9.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
